@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title Refactor ISA — cognition_solve_packet
start
:Entry after whole-program validation;

if (Program, instruction or values absent?) then (yes)
 :Return INVALID_ARGUMENT;
 stop
endif
:laplace_cognition_packet_execute_words(request, result capacity);
if (Native result-capacity status?) then (yes)
 :Return RESULT_CAPACITY_INSUFFICIENT;
 stop
elseif (Other non-OK status?) then (yes)
 :Return EXECUTION_FAILED;
 stop
endif
:Set output.count = native result word count;
:Return ISA_OK;
stop
legend
Execute-wrapper source trace.
Validation and native semantic callees are separate boundaries.
No runtime acceptance asserted.
endlegend
@enduml
